# Agent-skills symlink layer (machine-local). Canonical skill content is committed under
# .agents/skills/. Rebuild on restore, per pair:
#   ln -s ../../.agents/skills/<name> .claude/skills/<name>
# (Before the 2026-08-05 Linux move these were NTFS junctions, because core.symlinks=false on
# Windows would have duplicated the content. On Linux they are ordinary symlinks and recovery
# check C17 also catches a BROKEN one, which the old check could not distinguish from healthy.)
# The symlink layer also rides the encrypted vault backup.
.claude/skills/

# Chrome user-data profile (cookies, session tokens) - airbnb-host headed browser
**/.browser-profile/

