# ...and the same content under a DIFFERENT folder name (added 2026-07-29). The comment above always
# meant "build backups", but the pattern only named export/, so work/31-portal-scanner/build/ (extracted
# n8n node JS + the full src-03.json workflow, MASTER CV embedded verbatim) was staged for the public
# push and only the pre-commit personal-data scan caught it. Same class as the .jsonl.bak siblings
# below: a rename defeats a filename-shaped rule. Cover the folder name, not one instance of it.
work/*/build/
docs/n8n/*/workflow.json
# personal professional profile draft
work/12-linkedin-series/profile/
# soul = full personal identity; loaded locally by the session hook, never backed up
soul.md
